  (text "ERC power flags (no parts)" (at 127 186.69 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid fbabfe69-9b3d-5514-8480-45726d1de14f))
  (text "U2 AP63301: adjustable buck, 0.8 V FB, 500 kHz forced PWM, 3 A rated, 0.57 A worst case here.\nVout = 0.8 V x (1 + 93.1k / 30.1k) = 3.27 V. C13 56 pF feed-forward and C4, C5 2 x 22 uF per datasheet.\nL1 10 uH (datasheet range 2.2 to 10 uH): ripple 0.51 A at 14.6 V in. Isat 4.6 A at 20% drop.\nC6 220 uF is DNP: the datasheet characterises 22 to 68 uF out. Fit only if a load-step test shows a need.\nPort current worst case: about 220 mA peak, 50 mA average at 10 V battery.\nD2 blocks reverse polarity. D3 lets USB run the board on the bench, and D2 stops it back-feeding the brain.\nD1 18 V standoff clears a 14.6 V battery and clamps under the 35 V buck limit.\nR1 enables the buck from VIN. R2 (DNP) adds a UVLO divider, but fitted it stops USB start-up." (at 15.24 176.53 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b93810b8-9bc1-5941-8bf8-13511aeb0d89))
