  (text "5.1 k CC pulldowns: USB sink, 5 V only.\nR18/R19 22 ohm series close to U1. D+/D- as a 90 ohm pair.\nR22 drains D3 leakage so VBUS reads 0 V on port power and a host will attach." (at 330.2 100.33 0)
